-- title:
--   Prefix log-determinant $P_k(B)=\sum_{i\le k}\ln a_i$
-- statement:
--   Let $B=(b_1,\dots,b_m)$ be an ordered basis, $b_i^*$ its Gram–Schmidt vectors and $a_i=\|b_i^*\|$. The **prefix log-determinant** is
--   $$
--   P_k(B)=\sum_{i=1}^{k}\ln a_i\qquad(0\le k\le m),
--   $$
--   the logarithm of the covolume of the sublattice generated by $b_1,\dots,b_k$. In particular $P_0(B)=0$, and $P_m(B)=\ln\det L$, which is $0$ for a unimodular lattice.
--
--   The profile $k\mapsto P_k(B)$ controls the size of the enumeration tree of $B$ (Proposition 3.1), and the whole mission is phrased in terms of it.
--
--   **Formalization Note** Indices are 0-based: the Lean sum runs over the Gram–Schmidt lengths `gsLen b i` with `i < k` (`gsLen b i` is the paper's $a_{i+1}$). The vectors may live in any $\mathbb R^k$.
-- source:
--   Laarhoven, Asymptotics of Random-Lattice Enumeration: Beyond HKZ via Dense Sublattices, arXiv:2610.15265 (held version, sha256 8fa7a08a…), §2.1, (2.1) and (2.3), p.14

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_KannanLattice_Core_Lattice

namespace RandLatEnum

/-- The prefix log-determinant `P_k(B) = Σ_{i=1}^{k} ln a_i`, `a_i = ‖b*_i‖` (Laarhoven, *Asymptotics of Random-Lattice Enumeration: Beyond HKZ via Dense Sublattices*, arXiv:2610.15265 (held version, sha256 8fa7a08a…), §2.1, (2.1) and
(2.3), p.14): the logarithm of the covolume of the sublattice generated by `b_1, …, b_k`.

**Formalization Note.** Indices of `b` are 0-based (`gsLen b i` is the paper's `a_{i+1}`), so
`prefixLogDet b k` sums `ln (gsLen b i)` over `i < k`; `k` is a natural number, and for `k ≥ m` the
sum is over all `m` vectors. `P_0 = 0`. For a linearly independent `b` every `a_i > 0`. -/
noncomputable def prefixLogDet {m k : ℕ} (b : Fin m → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin k)) (j : ℕ) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i ∈ Finset.univ.filter (fun i : Fin m => (i : ℕ) < j), Real.log (KannanLattice.Core.gsLen b i)

end RandLatEnum


